WEBVTT

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.360
You let a vouivre get away?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.140
Sorry, Dix.

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.980
We found it on the Nineteenth Floor,
 but lost sight of it.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.810
We think another monster probably got it, but...

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:20.490
How could you let that chance go to waste?

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.750
If we'd sold it to some nobles from Eluria,

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.380
we could've gotten an insane 
amount of money for it.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.100
And you haven't found the monsters' lair yet,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.720
even though we know for sure it's 
in the Colossal Tree Labyrinth!

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.580
But a vouivre, huh?

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.570
I don't want to give up on a rare
species like that too easily.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.860
There's always a slim chance!

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.230
Go find out who was in Livira at the time!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.280
All right.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:52.820
So Ikelos-sama...

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.220
Might I ask you to lend us your strength?

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.990
That attitude. Is that any way to 
ask the god you serve for a favor?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.510
Cocky little brat.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.500
Gods can see through the lies of 
the people of the Lower World.

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:11.210
If that vouivre is alive and some 
idiot somewhere is hiding it,

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.260
I was hoping you might find that out for us.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.500
What a pain...

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:18.250
I am a god, you know!

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:21.750
Oh, but wouldn't it prevent 
you from being bored?

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.630
Guess I've got no choice.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:28.190
Give me a good laugh 
this time, too, all right, Dix?

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.960
<b>Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III</b>

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.740
Monster
One Wing

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.900
So we will have to go into the Dungeon, then...

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:07.060
Won't we?

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:08.000
Yes.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.790
I talked to Hephaistios and 
Take and the others, but...

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.460
if we want to know more about Wiene-kun,

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.890
there's a limit to what we'll learn aboveground.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:18.210
If we want to gather information, 
the Guild's the best place, but...

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.090
we don't want to dig around carelessly.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.690
Of course we don't.

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:25.740
If we're found out, our familia's 
standing would be endangered,

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.750
and who knows what would happen to her.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.050
Yes.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:33.140
That's why I'd like you to go into 
the Dungeon as secretly as possible.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.920
The place where you found Wiene-kun, 
the surrounding area...

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.910
Anything and everything. Look into it for me.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:40.490
Understood.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.390
Bell...

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.190
Are you going away?

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.410
It's all right. I'll be back soon.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:50.390
True. We don't really want 
to leave our Home empty.

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.550
If the two of you stay to look after things,

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:55.040
that means just three of us heading 
down to the Nineteenth Floor.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.500
It might take more than one day.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:03.480
Still, it's not like we can ask 
just anyone to come in and help.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:09.530
You want to go to Livira?

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.250
Y-Yes!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.110
And, um, if possible...

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:16.180
We were hoping you might help us, Ryu-san.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.950
Do you have something you need to do there?

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.000
W-Well, um...

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.390
Th-There's a sort of quest we 
need to get done within the day,

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:25.410
that's why...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.290
Cranel-san...

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:32.020
I apologize, but I do have my 
duties here at the restaurant—

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:33.240
Bell Cranel!

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.250
Aisha-san!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.700
Why are you here?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:41.540
I was in the area, so I thought 
I'd see how Haruhime is doing.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.000
Then I saw all of you.

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.760
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.280
Well... The thing is...

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.300
Wow, that's an Amazon for you.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.980
I see.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.410
So you're looking for an escort.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:01.100
Very well. I'll take that on.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.430
Really?

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:06.100
Of course. Just down to Livira and back, right?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.190
I've always wanted to go down into 
the Dungeon with you once.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:11.780
However...

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.670
I ask a high price for my services.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.070
I did miss my chance to have you, after all.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:21.610
This time, as we've come to an arrangement...

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.820
Move away, Amazon.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.180
I will not allow such lascivious 
behavior toward him.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:33.170
Huh? What do you want?

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:35.640
You got some kind of stake in this male, too?

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.950
Do not misunderstand.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.030
He already has a previous 
arrangement for life partnership.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:41.620
What?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:44.100
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:49.190
I've wished this boy a happily ever after 
with someone I care for as a little sister.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.870
I ask that you refrain from 
making irresponsible remarks.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.660
They will only cause trouble for Cranel-san.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.310
Right. I get it.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:01.540
I'll have a taste of him first, and that
 one can start with holding hands,

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:02.920
just like an elf should.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.450
I cannot entrust him to someone 
with such a lack of character.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.060
You are the one who should withdraw here.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.560
Syr...

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.840
I will take a half-day off.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.120
I'm sorry, but will you please tell Mama Mia?

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.320
What? Ryu?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.190
She is a danger.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:23.160
To safeguard Cranel-san's honor, 
I will travel with them and keep watch.

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:25.950
I will return for our evening business hours.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.530
A-All right...

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:31.440
Well, this is what we were hoping for, but...

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.970
Being a well-known adventurer apparently means

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:36.790
that everyone has their
eye on you. Must be a pain.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.250
Amazing!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.510
I was defeated by a certain someone, you see.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.280
After returning from the Rakian camp,

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:56.060
I spent time in the Dungeon 
retraining myself.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.840
Antianeira...

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:58.670
I see.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.140
So that's her.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.330
Huh. You're pretty good.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.750
As are you.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:27.710
Bell!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:28.700
Bell-sama!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.670
What's wrong, Cranel-san?

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.610
This isn't like you.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.680
What was that pathetic display?

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.430
You're making me lose interest.

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.410
Be that as it may, we should hurry.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:53.070
The Goliath on the Seventeenth 
Floor has been subdued.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.160
That's good. We'll slip 
through before it respawns.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.150
Bell...

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.940
You can't be...

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:12.710
Hey.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.510
They said they were going to 
exchange the drop items for cash,

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.250
but those two haven't come back.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.680
Would they have left you 
and gone off on their own?

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:25.660
I'm sure men have lots of things 
they want to do together, too.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:28.570
Something you don't want us 
to find out about, maybe?

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:33.100
Aisha-sama, what could you possibly 
be speaking of? Lili has no idea!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.390
You little pipsqueak...

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:45.370
I wonder if we should have said something 
to Ryu-san and Aisha-san before we left.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.900
If they came with us

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.500
and started prying into this more, 
it would only cause problems, right?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.230
Just leave them to Li'l Lili.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.960
We were just here,

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.960
but this floor really does seem a 
lot different than the others.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.610
I heard it's called the Colossal Tree Labyrinth.

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.600
They told me at the Guild.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.810
Really...

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.660
Was it around here?

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.170
Yes.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.620
This is where I found Wiene.

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.410
As we thought. There's nothing here.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:20.020
Guess things wouldn't be that easy.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.720
You smell of my kindred.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:46.930
What is this?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:50.200
Are you the ones who have abducted...

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:51.650
my kindred?

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.100
No, it is not.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.850
You do not smell of blood.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:59.590
Are you the ones Fels spoke of?

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:00.410
Fels?

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.910
I have one question.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.370
Do you believe we can coexist?

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.330
Coexist? Do you mean...

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.170
What are you talking about?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.020
You kill us.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:17.120
And we kill you.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.170
Is that our fate?

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:21.520
Can we not come to understand one another?

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:26.810
I want to bathe in the light of the sun.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.910
Rather than be in this confined, 
nightmarish abyss,

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.190
I want to try spreading my 
wings in a world of light.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:35.690
You two seem somehow different.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.700
I find myself hoping, just a little.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.830
A feather?

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.110
This has got to be a joke, right?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.540
She's... like Wiene?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:18.370
Oh? The Little Rookie's here?

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.450
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.370
I am certain he was here back then.

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:25.290
Really...

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:26.830
I smell something.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:31.010
Let's have them thoroughly
investigated, shall we?

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.500
Thank you, both of you.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:40.500
I am a little curious about 
what you two were doing,

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.580
but well, sometimes not asking is best.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:44.810
Cranel-san...

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.930
If you are in trouble, please come talk to me.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.220
I will help to the best of my meager abilities.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.070
I'll let you owe me my fees.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:56.110
Give my best to Haruhime for me.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:11:59.780
Well, then.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.820
Will you tell me now?

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:07.280
Both of you have seemed strange since you 
came back from the Nineteenth Floor.

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.260
Y-Yes...

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.920
About that...

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:13.640
To be honest, I haven't 
sorted out my thoughts yet.

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.750
Would it be all right to wait 
until we get back to Hestia-sama?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.630
Huh? Yes.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.470
I don't mind, but...

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:24.040
I'm sorry, Lili. I'd like just a little...

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.920
time to myself.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:33.980
Do you believe we can coexist?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.400
<i>Who...</i>

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.830
<i>Who was that person?</i>

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:40.570
Hey! Little Rookie!

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:45.080
Lucky break. Never thought 
I'd run into you here.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:48.070
Is there something I can help you with?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.620
No need to be so on guard.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.450
But I guess you can't help it.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:56.460
We seem pretty shady, right? Us gods.

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:58.390
I'm Ikelos.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:03.670
A cocky little brat's using me as the hook 
in his fishing expedition right now.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.840
I-I see...

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.020
You know anything about a talking vouivre?

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:17.390
Heard it's got a really pretty face!

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:20.400
Apparently, it appeared on 
the Nineteenth Floor.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.160
I just wanted a look, you know?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.660
That's why I'm asking around.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.400
Hey, Little Rookie...

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:29.600
If you happen to know anything...

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.610
What a coincidence, Bell-kun!

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.920
Hermes-sama...

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.700
Bell-kun, go ahead and go.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:39.200
You're having trouble because some 
strange god's got you cornered, right?

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:39.680
What?

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.620
I have some business with Ikelos, you see.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:44.100
Really...

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:51.710
Is information that the Ikelos Familia 
is involved with smuggling correct?

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.290
Huh?

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.240
Are you suspecting me of something?

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:58.870
I don't want to suspect a friend from Heaven,

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:04.280
but people say that your familia
was part of the dark faction, Evilus.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.130
Those are all false accusations!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:07.690
I'm not an evil god.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.680
One more thing.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.210
Unusual monsters have been spread around

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.970
from here in Orario as though they were
meant to spread chaos in this world.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.190
And you're trying to say I want that, Hermes?

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.660
That I'm sending beast dreams...

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:28.460
nightmares, throughout the Lower Realm?

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:30.130
That's hilarious!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:33.850
But I'm sad to say, I am 
not in any way involved.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.700
It's just the kids getting all excited.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.470
Lately, the ones that don't 
pay their god any respect,

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.690
the cocky ones, have been on the rise.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.370
They send me on errands for them.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.350
But you know...

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.490
Everything they do is so trivial and stupid

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.810
it really makes you laugh.

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:56.040
Keeping a tight hold on your familia's reins 
is part of a god's work, too, you know.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.350
The kids may not be able to take pain, 
but they never go against pleasure.

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.300
We're the same, aren't we?

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:05.300
That's why, as long as they entertain me,

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.750
I'm not going to stop them.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:11.910
Even if you kill me and send me back,
 it's not gonna stop the kids.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:15.950
They'll hide themselves, make a 
contract with a different god,

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.750
and keep on doing the same stupid stuff.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.710
They probably would.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.240
You should use the kids you've 
got hidden around here,

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:29.270
and search around me to your heart's content.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:32.460
Whatever. I don't care.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.660
Seems like it'll be more fun that way.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.370
How very unpleasant...

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.420
as are all gods who hunger for amusement.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.090
Haruhime, I found you!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.330
Oh, dear! I seem to have been discovered!

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:52.750
This time, it's your turn, Haruhime!

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:53.780
Yes.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.740
Now, I'll start counting.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:16:01.560
One... Two... Three... Four...

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.490
Bell's scent...

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:30.080
Bell...

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.500
Is he not back yet?

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.210
Is that true, Welf-kun?

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:39.210
There was a monster who could 
talk besides Wiene-kun?

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.400
Yes.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.050
On the Nineteenth Floor...

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:44.490
apparently, in the same place Bell met Wiene.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.690
There are others like Wiene-dono?

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:52.690
According to that person, 
we "smell of her kindred."

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:00.070
Lili believes we should cease 
sheltering Wiene-sama.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.750
Lili-dono! What are you saying?

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.970
We have stepped into an 
extraordinarily tense, difficult issue.

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.880
Any further than this would be too dangerous.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.300
But then, Wiene-dono would be...

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.510
We have the option of letting 
her free outside of Orario.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.180
She is a vouivre.

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:21.550
She must be far stronger than any 
monsters inhabiting the surface.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:22.800
Lili-dono!

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:26.380
Then say we continue to shelter her.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:27.890
What do we do?

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.960
We can't hide her forever.

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:34.110
Can you say for certain that she 
is a completely tame monster?

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:36.320
No one will believe that.

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:39.390
She is a bomb just waiting to go off.

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:40.970
Even if things are all right for now,

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:43.540
one day she will expose this familia to danger.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:47.330
We can't leave this to our 
softhearted Bell-sama.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:51.540
Whether it means we are hated or despised, 
Lili and the others must make a decision.

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.390
We and Wiene-sama...

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.340
cannot remain together.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.300
She is...

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.300
a monster.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.200
It couldn't be...

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.640
<i>Why? Why?</i>

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:21.020
<i>Why is it bad for me to be 
with everyone... with Bell?</i>

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.470
<i>Bell...</i>

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.870
<i>Bell, where are you?</i>

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:25.330
<i>Bell...</i>

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:26.900
<i>Bell!</i>

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.750
Wiene is gone?

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.560
We were careless.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:34.120
We never thought she might be listening.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.620
Welf-kun and the others have already 
split up and gone to look for her.

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:39.820
I'm going, too!

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:44.720
Please be safe, Wiene-kun.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.900
Bell, where are you?

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.140
Are you all right?

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.080
I-It's a monster!

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.540
A harpy... No! A siren?

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:43.780
How can there be a monster here?

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.850
It's dangerous!

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.330
Monster...

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.030
Stay back!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.170
How can it be in town?

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:49.960
Huh?

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:52.820
You... You monster!

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.120
Get out of here, monster!

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.670
This is our town!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:07.570
Go back to the Dungeon you came from!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:09.360
It hurts... It hurts!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.650
Get out of here! Go back where you came from!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.040
Help me...

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.210
Help me, Bell!

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:21.310
Let me through! Please, let me through!

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:25.860
Welf?

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:27.650
What are you planning
to do when you get there?

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:30.300
If you help her now, there's no
 talking your way out of it!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.040
But...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.680
I can't just leave her like that!

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.490
Bell!

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:37.080
Wiene!

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.870
Go to the secret room in the cellar.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.220
They went that way!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.830
Who was that elf?

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.800
Someone get word to the Guild, quickly!

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:54.910
Bell-dono!

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.460
That was...

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.750
Li'l Lili, wasn't it?

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.150
Yes. Let's go.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.400
Wh-Where are we going?

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.440
To the secret room in the cellar...

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.980
to our Home.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:16.200
Bell...

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:20.670
Is it bad... for me to be with you, Bell?

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.390
Hey! Did you find them?

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:43.910
They're not over this way!

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:47.220
So it didn't work out.

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:53.950
Their circumstances did serve 
as a ray of hope. However...

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:55.210
It seems it was too distant after all.

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:58.460
What will you do, Ouranos?

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Xenos
Outliers</b>

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:38.340
Next time,

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:39.430
"Xenos."
